WEBVTT

00:07:27.836 --> 00:07:32.076
we have a chance to actually
experience the benefits fast,

00:07:32.116 --> 00:07:33.796
in our lifetimes.

00:07:34.196 --> 00:07:35.396
For example,

00:07:35.436 --> 00:07:38.876
my colleagues and I found that we could
slow down the rate of warming

00:07:38.916 --> 00:07:43.316
by as much as 30 percent
before mid-century.

00:07:43.356 --> 00:07:46.316
This would help communities
and ecosystems adapt

00:07:46.356 --> 00:07:47.916
to a changing climate

00:07:47.956 --> 00:07:50.556
and hit the brakes on worsening
extreme events,

00:07:50.596 --> 00:07:53.636
like wildfires in the Americas
and Australia,

00:07:53.676 --> 00:07:55.916
and flooding in Europe and Asia.

00:07:56.556 --> 00:08:00.396
It would also help clean up our air,
saving lives and crops,